  "body_html": "<h1>sample_zermelo_determinacy</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem sample_zermelo_determinacy : (∀ σ' : Strategy Player ℚ, IVariant (1 : Player) optStrategy σ' → value₀ sample ≤ outcome σ' sample 0) ∧ (∀ σ' : Strategy Player ℚ, IVariant (0 : Player) optStrategy σ' → outcome σ' sample 0 ≤ value₀ sample)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategy</li>\n<li>IsCompletelyMixedProfile.player</li>\n<li>IsCompletelyMixed.player</li>\n<li>Player</li>\n<li>IVariant</li>\n<li>zermelo_determinacy</li>\n<li>sample_zero_sum</li>\n</ul>",
